Package: morserunner-linux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libpulse0
Description: Native Linux CW contest simulator
 Morse Runner simulates CW contest pile-ups, single calls, WPX competition,
 and HST competition. This package contains the native GTK3/PulseAudio build.
